### Debug Control Generator
```javascript
class DebugControlGenerator {
  generateControls(object, name) {
    const controls = {};
    
    // Standardized 1-10 range for all numeric properties
    if (object.position) {
      controls[`${name}PositionX`] = this.createSlider('Position X', 1, 10, this.normalizeValue(object.position.x, -10, 10));
      controls[`${name}PositionY`] = this.createSlider('Position Y', 1, 10, this.normalizeValue(object.position.y, -10, 10));
      controls[`${name}PositionZ`] = this.createSlider('Position Z', 1, 10, this.normalizeValue(object.position.z, 1, 20));
    }
    
    // Add performance monitoring for each control
    controls[`${name}Performance`] = this.createPerformanceDisplay(name);
    
    return controls;
  }

  normalizeValue(value, min, max) {
    // Convert actual value to 1-10 range
    return Math.max(1, Math.min(10, ((value - min) / (max - min)) * 9 + 1));
  }

  denormalizeValue(normalizedValue, min, max) {
    // Convert 1-10 range back to actual value
    return min + ((normalizedValue - 1) / 9) * (max - min);
  }
}
```

## State Management Rules

### Central State Store
- Use `AppStateManager` for all scene state
- All state changes must go through the state manager
- State updates must be immutable
- Use event bus for state change notifications

### State Update Pattern
```javascript
// Correct state update
this.stateManager.setState({
  camera: {
    position: { x: newX, y: newY, z: newZ },
    rotation: { x: newRX, y: newRY, z: newRZ }
  }
});

// Emit change event
this.eventBus.emit('cameraStateChanged', { position: newPosition, rotation: newRotation });
```

### Comment System State Management
```javascript
// Comment state structure
const commentState = {
  comments: {
    [eventId]: [
      {
        id: 'comment_123',
        eventId: 'event_456',
        userId: 'user_789',
        content: 'This is a great milestone!',
        timestamp: 1640995200000,
        likes: 5,
        replies: [],
        isModerated: false,
        isVisible: true
      }
    ]
  },
  ui: {
    selectedEvent: null,
    showComments: false,
    commentFormVisible: false,
    moderationMode: false
  },
  settings: {
    maxCommentsPerEvent: 50,
    autoModeration: false,
    allowReplies: true,
    allowLikes: true
  }
};

// Comment state updates
this.stateManager.setState({
  comments: {
    ...this.stateManager.getState().comments,
    [eventId]: [...existingComments, newComment]
  }
});

// Emit comment events
this.eventBus.emit('commentAdded', { eventId, comment: newComment });
this.eventBus.emit('commentUpdated', { commentId, updates });
this.eventBus.emit('commentDeleted', { commentId, eventId });
```

### Camera Behavior Coordination
- **Priority System**: User input > Scroll-driven > Timeline > Default
- **Interrupt Handling**: Always allow user input to interrupt animations
- **Smooth Blending**: Use GSAP for all transitions with easing
- **State Validation**: Validate all camera positions before applying

